271
00:18:42,910 --> 00:18:45,680
the moment someone else
takes control of the software.

272
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:21,610
No need to be shy.

273
00:19:21,790 --> 00:19:23,320
Feel free to flirt as much as you want.

274
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:25,400
Tod and I are heading to our faculty.

275
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:27,340
Me? When did I...

276
00:19:28,050 --> 00:19:29,780
- I just got back from the faculty.
- Go!

277
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:32,730
Isn't it too close?

278
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,130
I want to look at you up close.

279
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:37,690
Can't I?

280
00:19:40,150 --> 00:19:41,660
What's with you?

281
00:19:42,930 --> 00:19:44,790
Why do you sound so stern
when you're blushing?

282
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:48,840
You know that makes me blush,

283
00:19:49,410 --> 00:19:50,950
so why do you keep teasing me?

284
00:19:51,540 --> 00:19:52,580
Go away.

285
00:19:54,390 --> 00:19:55,640
I'm not teasing.

286
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:58,770
I already told you that night at the beach...

287
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:01,310
that I'm not messing around.

288
00:20:07,410 --> 00:20:08,740
So this is how they do it, huh?

289
00:20:09,470 --> 00:20:10,600
What do you mean?

290
00:20:13,180 --> 00:20:14,340
You know,

291
00:20:14,980 --> 00:20:16,560
how soccer players flirt.

292
00:20:18,490 --> 00:20:19,380
No wonder...

293
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:21,580
the girls

294
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:24,880
fall head over heels.

295
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:27,320
Are you jealous?

296
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,070
If you're jealous,
then be my boyfriend

297
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:36,080
so they can be jealous of you instead.

298
00:20:44,080 --> 00:20:45,140
You know...

299
00:20:45,730 --> 00:20:47,540
sports science majors and engineering students

300
00:20:48,530 --> 00:20:49,480
can't stand each other.

301
00:20:53,190 --> 00:20:54,580
That means...

302
00:20:55,630 --> 00:20:57,680
you're not saying no, right?

303
00:20:59,260 --> 00:21:00,190
What?

304
00:21:02,220 --> 00:21:04,200
Don't wanna date an engineering student?

305
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:08,170
No.

306
00:21:11,300 --> 00:21:13,030
Then how about dating a soccer player?

307
00:21:35,580 --> 00:21:37,580
How do you end up drenched
just from drinking water?

308
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:40,150
Well, it's hot.

309
00:21:43,010 --> 00:21:44,500
Go take a shower.

310
00:21:48,660 --> 00:21:49,520
What's wrong?

311
00:21:51,580 --> 00:21:52,610
My wrist hurts.

312
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,470
I guess I can't shower by myself anymore.

313
00:21:56,740 --> 00:21:57,780
Wanna get hurt for real, huh?

314
00:21:59,250 --> 00:21:59,980
Damn,

315
00:22:00,410 --> 00:22:01,240
someone's got a temper.

316
00:22:07,910 --> 00:22:09,940
So, how is it on your end?

317
00:22:10,610 --> 00:22:12,010
Found anything suspicious?

318
00:22:14,430 --> 00:22:16,000
It seems Anda's car was hacked.

319
00:22:18,080 --> 00:22:19,560
The more I think about it,

320
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,980
the more I feel sorry for him.

321
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:26,340
What did he do to deserve this?

322
00:22:31,420 --> 00:22:33,940
Not to mention the CCTV being broken
at that exact spot.

323
00:22:37,070 --> 00:22:39,220
What did the condo staff say?

324
00:22:39,610 --> 00:22:40,410
Do you know?

325
00:22:42,740 --> 00:22:43,580
I don't.

326
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:49,200
We'll find the killer no matter what.

327
00:23:08,610 --> 00:23:09,370
Podduang.

328
00:23:12,170 --> 00:23:13,570
I have a scholarship ceremony tomorrow.

329
00:23:16,870 --> 00:23:17,630
Please come.

330
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:23,290
Okay.

331
00:23:39,580 --> 00:23:41,020
I went out to practice soccer,

332
00:23:41,060 --> 00:23:42,240
came back to shower,

333
00:23:42,370 --> 00:23:43,540
went out to eat,

334
00:23:43,570 --> 00:23:44,770
came back to watch a movie,

335
00:23:44,790 --> 00:23:45,820
and played games,

336
00:23:45,840 --> 00:23:47,220
but you're still in the same spot.

337
00:23:51,010 --> 00:23:52,400
- Babe.
- Yeah?

338
00:23:52,420 --> 00:23:53,270
Come here.

339
00:24:08,950 --> 00:24:10,910
Everyone in this photo
is friends with each other.

340
00:24:10,930 --> 00:24:12,010
They're all the same age.

341
00:24:12,230 --> 00:24:15,050
The first one is Nam Kanyarat, a doctor.

342
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:17,990
The second one is Cha-em.

343
00:24:18,010 --> 00:24:19,510
Used to be a flight attendant.
Now married.

344
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:22,740
The third one is Nan.
She's already passed away.

345
00:24:22,770 --> 00:24:23,710
Skip that one.

346
00:24:24,430 --> 00:24:26,510
The fourth one is now a butch

347
00:24:26,860 --> 00:24:28,550
named Bew,
who is an insurance agent.

348
00:24:29,380 --> 00:24:32,700
The last one is a voice teacher named Toey,

349
00:24:32,740 --> 00:24:34,390
but she's been abroad for three months now.

350
00:24:34,410 --> 00:24:35,730
She hasn't come back at all.

351
00:24:36,150 --> 00:24:37,590
So you're asking me...

352
00:24:37,620 --> 00:24:40,630
who is the most likely person
to have killed Anda?

353
00:24:41,010 --> 00:24:41,670
Yes.

354
00:24:42,080 --> 00:24:43,810
How would I know?

355
00:24:44,870 --> 00:24:46,340
Maybe Cha-em?

356
00:24:46,360 --> 00:24:49,070
Her name sounds kinda like Emma.

357
00:24:49,470 --> 00:24:51,630
Maybe she went to study abroad,

358
00:24:51,650 --> 00:24:54,260
and to make her name easier to pronounce,
she became Emma.

359
00:24:54,780 --> 00:24:55,990
That sounds plausible,

360
00:24:56,810 --> 00:24:58,000
but it's not her.

361
00:24:58,370 --> 00:25:00,610
I suspected her the most, too,

362
00:25:01,290 --> 00:25:02,840
but after digging deeper,

363
00:25:04,210 --> 00:25:05,540
there was nothing suspicious at all.

364
00:25:06,450 --> 00:25:07,360
Honestly,

365
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,380
look,

366
00:25:09,590 --> 00:25:11,020
I'm starting to suspect you now.

367
00:25:11,180 --> 00:25:12,790
How did you get all this information?

368
00:25:13,150 --> 00:25:15,910
This is where haters wage their wars.

369
00:25:17,010 --> 00:25:17,740
That's scary.

370
00:25:18,210 --> 00:25:19,850
I'm afraid to do anything wrong now.

371
00:25:21,780 --> 00:25:23,780
You're not even supposed
to think about doing it.

372
00:25:25,090 --> 00:25:26,060
My apologies.

373
00:25:27,210 --> 00:25:27,900
Anyway,

374
00:25:28,800 --> 00:25:30,470
if it's not one of these five people,

375
00:25:30,840 --> 00:25:32,460
that just leaves
the person who took the photo.

376
00:25:34,580 --> 00:25:35,520
What?

377
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:37,920
What?

378
00:25:37,940 --> 00:25:39,030
You're so smart.

379
00:25:39,430 --> 00:25:40,170
What?

380
00:25:47,800 --> 00:25:49,950
[Certificate Presentation Ceremony
for Outstanding Scholarship Students]

381
00:25:49,970 --> 00:25:51,050
[Special Program, 2026]

382
00:25:59,280 --> 00:26:00,600
Who are you looking for?

383
00:26:02,670 --> 00:26:03,310
Well...

384
00:26:04,450 --> 00:26:06,080
I actually invited Podduang to come along.

385
00:26:08,980 --> 00:26:12,420
Alright, scholarship students.
Let's get a group photo right here.

386
00:26:13,050 --> 00:26:13,920
Come, everyone.

387
00:26:13,940 --> 00:26:14,840
Okay.

388
00:26:14,870 --> 00:26:17,440
Group photo, everyone.
Please move closer together.

389
00:26:17,820 --> 00:26:19,970
Okay. One, two, three!

390
00:26:21,540 --> 00:26:24,150
Okay. Smile. One, two, three!

391
00:26:24,920 --> 00:26:26,090
Thank you.

392
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,530
Thank you.

393
00:26:27,910 --> 00:26:28,750
Thank you.

394
00:26:29,010 --> 00:26:30,680
Wait, Risa and Jin.

395
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:32,540
Let's get a photo of you two.

396
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:34,860
I'll post it to promote our college.

397
00:26:35,220 --> 00:26:37,050
- Come on, the two of you.
- Move to the center, please.

398
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,090
Good.

399
00:26:38,270 --> 00:26:39,750
- Excellent.
- A bit more to the left.

400
00:26:39,790 --> 00:26:40,780
Good.

401
00:26:41,050 --> 00:26:43,640
One, two, three.

402
00:26:44,050 --> 00:26:45,010
Okay.

403
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:47,580
Smile. One, two...

404
00:26:47,610 --> 00:26:49,840
That's my friend.

405
00:26:50,220 --> 00:26:52,580
Relax, bro. Take it easy.

406
00:26:54,120 --> 00:26:55,170
Three!

407
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:59,570
Do you want to
grab some food together after this?

408
00:27:01,660 --> 00:27:03,090
I already have plans.

409
00:27:04,060 --> 00:27:06,880
Oh, you're going to celebrate with Tod and Art?

410
00:27:13,750 --> 00:27:16,850
Alright, three more photos.
Come on, guys.

411
00:27:17,340 --> 00:27:19,040
Okay. A little bit closer together.

412
00:27:19,070 --> 00:27:20,700
Turn slightly toward each other.

413
00:27:21,230 --> 00:27:24,080
One, two, three!

414
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:29,690
How about tomorrow, then?

415
00:27:29,830 --> 00:27:32,570
Let's go celebrate.
I'll invite all our friends, too.

416
00:27:37,580 --> 00:27:39,560
Well, I...

417
00:27:52,980 --> 00:27:54,340
Is it Podduang again?

418
00:27:54,940 --> 00:27:57,430
Are you really serious about him?

419
00:27:59,550 --> 00:28:01,610
You can just tell me. I'll be fine.

420
00:28:02,020 --> 00:28:02,710
Yeah.

421
00:28:05,780 --> 00:28:07,570
I'm very serious about Podduang.

422
00:28:10,950 --> 00:28:13,600
Right. That's clear enough.

423
00:28:19,150 --> 00:28:23,930
This round goes to Podduang.
Risa's down 1-0.

424
00:28:24,490 --> 00:28:26,850
The queen just lost to the secret player.

425
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:36,540
Alright, let's get one more set.

426
00:28:36,570 --> 00:28:38,210
I want you to look cheerful in this one.

427
00:28:38,990 --> 00:28:41,240
Give me a big smile, please.

428
00:28:41,260 --> 00:28:44,040
You can do the finger heart.
One, two, three.

429
00:28:44,070 --> 00:28:45,180
Good.

430
00:28:45,340 --> 00:28:47,460
Beautiful. One more.
One, two, three.

431
00:28:48,710 --> 00:28:49,780
One more, please.

432
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:11,210
Mr. Chanin...

433
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:37,360
[Certificate for Jinna Ronnarak]

434
00:29:41,690 --> 00:29:43,390
I thought you weren't coming.

435
00:29:43,670 --> 00:29:44,760
I wasn't going to.

436
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:47,090
I was gonna help Bumm
track down that hater.

437
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:51,360
Jeez, you were panting
with your tongue out just now.

438
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:53,780
Hey, I'm not a dog.

439
00:29:54,710 --> 00:29:55,820
Just kidding.

440
00:29:58,320 --> 00:29:59,450
Let me see.

441
00:30:01,890 --> 00:30:03,270
You're good at school

442
00:30:04,390 --> 00:30:05,980
and soccer...

443
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:12,380
And you've got a smart mouth, too.

444
00:30:13,180 --> 00:30:14,100
But I think...

445
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:16,580
you're actually better at using your mouth.

446
00:30:18,330 --> 00:30:18,930
Come on.

447
00:30:20,250 --> 00:30:21,230
There are people around.

448
00:30:21,410 --> 00:30:23,250
Why? Did I make you blush?

449
00:30:25,540 --> 00:30:27,300
What do you mean?
I'm not blushing.

450
00:30:30,630 --> 00:30:33,870
Aren't you eating
with the other scholarship students?

451
00:30:33,890 --> 00:30:35,150
They're coming out now.

452
00:30:41,810 --> 00:30:43,240
I smell someone being jealous.

453
00:30:45,220 --> 00:30:46,810
I'm asking nicely.
Don't get on my nerves.

454
00:30:47,210 --> 00:30:50,080
I won't eat with them.
I'd rather give you a ride.

455
00:30:51,490 --> 00:30:52,290
Just a ride?

456
00:30:53,130 --> 00:30:54,260
I can go anywhere

457
00:30:54,910 --> 00:30:56,040
as long as it's with you.

458
00:31:05,480 --> 00:31:07,830
What are you waiting for?
Aren't you coming?

459
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:09,920
Hurry up.

460
00:31:24,080 --> 00:31:26,190
No reward for giving you a ride?

461
00:31:26,690 --> 00:31:27,490
Nope.

462
00:31:29,040 --> 00:31:32,340
It's okay. Just making you blush
makes it all worth it.

463
00:31:33,450 --> 00:31:34,300
Don't be so dramatic.

464
00:31:35,650 --> 00:31:36,830
Look at those squishy cheeks.

465
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:38,820
Stop that.

466
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:42,020
I only do this with you, though.

467
00:31:43,540 --> 00:31:44,490
I hope that's true.

468
00:31:45,190 --> 00:31:46,710
You're the only one I'm flirting with.

469
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:52,170
Do you realize...

470
00:31:53,490 --> 00:31:54,980
you're everyone's crush?

471
00:31:57,140 --> 00:31:58,130
I kind of know.

472
00:32:00,330 --> 00:32:01,860
And...

473
00:32:03,480 --> 00:32:05,820
Risa is so cute.

474
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:09,640
Don't you feel anything for her?

475
00:32:11,950 --> 00:32:13,560
I already have someone I like.

476
00:32:16,150 --> 00:32:17,650
Why would I have feelings for someone else?

477
00:32:21,990 --> 00:32:25,290
Actually, I've liked him for a long time.

478
00:32:27,840 --> 00:32:29,980
I noticed him when he came
to watch his friend play soccer.

479
00:32:31,680 --> 00:32:33,540
He didn't even want to talk to me at first.

480
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:34,490
Look.

481
00:32:36,810 --> 00:32:38,060
He's just like you,

482
00:32:38,730 --> 00:32:39,980
always turning away.

483
00:32:41,430 --> 00:32:42,810
I guess...

484
00:32:45,240 --> 00:32:47,010
he thought you were trying to upset him.

485
00:32:49,340 --> 00:32:50,840
That's why he hated your guts.

486
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:54,450
What about now?

487
00:32:58,340 --> 00:32:59,250
Well...

488
00:33:04,760 --> 00:33:05,880
He doesn't hate you anymore.

489
00:33:07,420 --> 00:33:08,450
Really?

490
00:33:09,540 --> 00:33:12,480
Don't you think
he has feelings for me, baby?

491
00:33:14,780 --> 00:33:16,220
Baby, my ass.

492
00:33:17,090 --> 00:33:19,080
Why are you being so rude, baby?

493
00:33:20,970 --> 00:33:22,080
I'm leaving now.

494
00:33:23,760 --> 00:33:25,550
I gave you a ride. Now I'm tired.

495
00:33:26,230 --> 00:33:27,880
Aren't you gonna invite me
to your room, baby?

496
00:33:30,090 --> 00:33:31,580
Podduang, baby.

497
00:33:32,910 --> 00:33:34,130
Podduang...

498
00:33:50,380 --> 00:33:53,750
There are rumors that you will step down
from your executive position.

499
00:33:53,770 --> 00:33:55,070
Is there any truth to that?

500
00:33:55,210 --> 00:33:56,490
Rumors are just rumors.

501
00:33:56,740 --> 00:33:58,580
I have no intention of stepping down.

502
00:33:59,010 --> 00:34:01,660
And regarding Anda,
the late famous series actor

503
00:34:01,690 --> 00:34:04,180
who was found dead in your condo's parking lot,

504
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:06,430
have you been cooperating
with the police investigation?

505
00:34:06,450 --> 00:34:08,310
Of course, I've been giving them
my full cooperation.

506
00:34:08,520 --> 00:34:11,790
It's just unfortunate that the CCTV in that area
happened to be broken.

507
00:34:12,010 --> 00:34:13,260
- But as for the evidence,
- Took you so long.

508
00:34:13,290 --> 00:34:14,900
I've submitted all of it to the police.

509
00:34:15,520 --> 00:34:16,980
The CCTV shouldn't have been broken.

510
00:34:18,730 --> 00:34:20,969
I don't think it was broken.

511
00:34:22,810 --> 00:34:24,300
Someone probably sabotaged it.

512
00:34:32,290 --> 00:34:34,090
Regarding your plans to step down

513
00:34:34,110 --> 00:34:36,310
and let your successor take over,

514
00:34:36,409 --> 00:34:38,710
will that be happening anytime soon?

515
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:50,520
Master still wants to talk to you, Mr. Jin.

516
00:34:51,420 --> 00:34:52,800
He said he would agree to anything

517
00:34:53,699 --> 00:34:55,040
as long as you come to see him.

518
00:34:55,219 --> 00:34:56,330
Please just leave.

519
00:34:57,050 --> 00:34:58,090
I don't want to be part of this.

520
00:35:11,930 --> 00:35:14,320
The veggies are here.

521
00:35:16,500 --> 00:35:17,650
Do they look good?

522
00:35:17,800 --> 00:35:19,480
Yeah, they look amazing.

523
00:35:19,570 --> 00:35:22,870
I made four kinds of curry for you as well.

524
00:35:22,980 --> 00:35:25,300
This is your favorite,
the curry with meatballs.

525
00:35:25,490 --> 00:35:27,620
Wow, you really know what I want.

526
00:35:28,470 --> 00:35:29,120
Let's eat.

527
00:35:30,040 --> 00:35:31,360
Alright.

528
00:35:34,950 --> 00:35:37,290
You don't have to visit me so often.

529
00:35:37,630 --> 00:35:40,280
Why? Do you not love me anymore?

530
00:35:40,820 --> 00:35:42,150
It's not like that.

531
00:35:42,170 --> 00:35:44,580
It's just that
I don't want to take up your time.

532
00:35:44,600 --> 00:35:46,880
Come on, what do you mean by that?

533
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:49,570
Look, I have something to show you.

534
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:54,130
What is this?

535
00:35:57,910 --> 00:35:59,140
Listen, Auntie.
[Jinna Ronnarak, Outstanding Scholarship Student]

536
00:35:59,170 --> 00:36:02,020
I just want some free food.
It's not like I missed you.

537
00:36:02,540 --> 00:36:03,920
You're amazing.

538
00:36:05,210 --> 00:36:06,180
Well,

539
00:36:06,870 --> 00:36:07,980
are you lonely, though?

540
00:36:08,220 --> 00:36:08,870
Oh, come on!

541
00:36:09,550 --> 00:36:11,010
I'm not lonely at all.

542
00:36:12,910 --> 00:36:14,840
Maew and Nuan,

543
00:36:15,100 --> 00:36:18,050
my friends, ask me
to play mahjong with them every day.

544
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:20,040
It's good
that you've got some friends.

545
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:23,370
What about you? Are you lonely?

546
00:36:23,690 --> 00:36:25,470
How come you're still not dating anyone?

547
00:36:29,450 --> 00:36:31,580
Breaking business news today:

548
00:36:31,580 --> 00:36:33,400
The illness of Chanin,

549
00:36:33,430 --> 00:36:36,460
the famous real estate mogul of Thailand,

550
00:36:36,490 --> 00:36:38,710
has worsened for unknown reasons.

551
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:47,080
Does he still try to contact you?

552
00:36:48,620 --> 00:36:49,450
I don't know,

553
00:36:50,070 --> 00:36:51,550
and I don't want to know, either.

554
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:57,190
Jin, it's been a long time
since that happened.

555
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,930
The longer, the better.

556
00:37:00,100 --> 00:37:02,600
Right now, you're more than enough for me.

557
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:05,750
But your dad probably needs you.

558
00:37:07,330 --> 00:37:10,630
And that lawyer
has come here many times, too.

559
00:37:11,470 --> 00:37:12,660
Does he want me

560
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:16,050
or someone to take over his business?

561
00:37:19,220 --> 00:37:21,600
Come on, don't make that face.

562
00:37:21,630 --> 00:37:23,300
You're supposed to take my side.

563
00:37:23,950 --> 00:37:24,640
Yeah.

564
00:37:25,270 --> 00:37:27,390
I'm always taking your side.

565
00:37:30,010 --> 00:37:30,740
Come on.

566
00:37:31,540 --> 00:37:33,070
- Let's eat.
- Sure.

567
00:37:33,870 --> 00:37:37,600
Now, which curry do you want?
Let me get you some first.

568
00:37:37,690 --> 00:37:39,780
I want this. Give me the veggies first.

569
00:37:39,810 --> 00:37:40,500
Whoa.

570
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:43,150
Eating healthy, huh?

571
00:37:47,420 --> 00:37:48,320
Good.

572
00:37:51,150 --> 00:37:53,700
Seriously, would you go this far
if it were for me?

573
00:37:54,980 --> 00:37:56,000
What kind of question is that?

574
00:38:05,670 --> 00:38:06,340
Babe.

575
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:09,590
Look. He never posted anything,

576
00:38:09,770 --> 00:38:12,460
but now that he's dating our friend,
he's suddenly taking selfies.

577
00:38:12,890 --> 00:38:14,060
Look at this.

578
00:38:14,240 --> 00:38:15,890
You can't even read the certificate.

579
00:38:18,830 --> 00:38:19,760
See?

580
00:38:27,630 --> 00:38:28,390
Take this.

581
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:30,850
What, babe?

582
00:38:33,350 --> 00:38:34,150
You'll take a photo?

583
00:38:34,810 --> 00:38:35,630
Alright.

584
00:38:37,250 --> 00:38:38,200
Hey, you're blocking it.

585
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:39,600
Blocking what?

586
00:38:43,240 --> 00:38:44,180
What are you doing?

587
00:38:58,920 --> 00:38:59,910
Amp!

588
00:39:00,830 --> 00:39:01,740
Sir!

589
00:39:02,260 --> 00:39:03,840
- Help!
- Coming!

590
00:39:05,520 --> 00:39:07,330
- Can you walk?
- Yes.

591
00:39:15,090 --> 00:39:17,740
[I'm taking Amp to the hospital.]

592
00:39:22,770 --> 00:39:23,590
"AMME..."

593
00:39:24,650 --> 00:39:26,640
Amme? Who's that?

594
00:39:30,860 --> 00:39:31,720
Take deep breaths.

595
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:36,380
Relatives aren't allowed inside.
Please step out.

596
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:38,950
Sir, are you a relative?

597
00:39:38,970 --> 00:39:42,190
No, I'm not.
I'm just her neighbor.

598
00:39:42,250 --> 00:39:44,130
Do you have
any of her personal information?

599
00:39:49,510 --> 00:39:51,020
Is her ID card okay?

600
00:39:51,630 --> 00:39:52,310
Thank you very much.

601
00:39:56,450 --> 00:39:59,260
Podduang once told me
about his neighbor named Amp.

602
00:39:59,540 --> 00:40:01,150
She's an Anda fan, too.

603
00:40:02,900 --> 00:40:04,200
It's definitely her.

604
00:40:08,490 --> 00:40:09,520
I can't wait any longer.

605
00:40:10,210 --> 00:40:11,840
You keep trying to reach Podduang.

606
00:40:13,060 --> 00:40:14,180
Why isn't he picking up?

607
00:40:17,310 --> 00:40:19,060
[Anda's hater face reveal!
Could this be the killer?]

608
00:40:19,080 --> 00:40:20,630
[#JusticeForAnda]

609
00:40:38,420 --> 00:40:39,590
What about my baby?

610
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:43,270
Where's the doctor?

611
00:40:48,390 --> 00:40:50,490
The nurse said the baby is safe.

612
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:03,970
Thank you, Podduang.

613
00:41:07,790 --> 00:41:09,480
I'm really sorry, Amp.

614
00:41:10,330 --> 00:41:13,950
I hope you don't mind
that I gave your ID to the nurse.

615
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:16,690
Oh.

616
00:41:17,550 --> 00:41:18,550
It's okay.

617
00:41:21,030 --> 00:41:22,060
You should rest.

618
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:25,830
You can call me anytime
if you need anything.

619
00:42:18,010 --> 00:42:22,180
[Nurses' Station]

620
00:42:35,090 --> 00:42:38,390
[10 missed calls from Dunk]

621
00:42:40,160 --> 00:42:42,490
Breaking news, everyone.
An account called "Andaman TH"

622
00:42:42,520 --> 00:42:45,090
was created by one of the fans
of the late actor Anda,

623
00:42:45,110 --> 00:42:47,660
whose death was ruled a suicide

624
00:42:47,690 --> 00:42:49,250
by authorities.

625
00:42:49,270 --> 00:42:53,030
The account has revealed
the identity of this Anda's hater.

626
00:42:53,500 --> 00:42:55,950
However, we have to blur her face for now

627
00:42:55,970 --> 00:42:56,710
- Right.
- because...

628
00:42:56,740 --> 00:42:58,690
we haven't yet verified the information.

629
00:42:58,710 --> 00:43:00,540
Anyway, we know that

630
00:43:00,560 --> 00:43:02,190
this hater

631
00:43:02,220 --> 00:43:04,740
once sent Anda a bloodstained doll.
[Go to hell already!]

632
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:15,180
[The Chemistry is Real! Fans Show Up in Force
to Welcome Them on Day One]

633
00:43:41,070 --> 00:43:43,570
Furthermore, Andaman TH

634
00:43:43,600 --> 00:43:45,540
also revealed that this woman

635
00:43:45,570 --> 00:43:48,940
had looked into Anda's family background.

636
00:43:49,060 --> 00:43:52,200
Right, haters can be so terrifying these days,

637
00:43:52,230 --> 00:43:54,360
